        <mxCell id="tech" value="&lt;b&gt;Technology Stack&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Flutter&lt;/b&gt; — Dart — Customer App &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; | &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;b&gt;ASP.NET MVC&lt;/b&gt; — C# — Staff Web App &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; | &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Supabase&lt;/b&gt; — PostgreSQL • Authentication • Real-time • Storage" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f6f7f9;strokeColor=#c8cdd4;fontColor=#243447;fontSize=15;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
